 /* Non-consuming one-call snapshot: capacity5000 for frozen bank,10000 for app.
  * Input reserved/lost_updates/sequence must0. count0+entries0 probes only.
  * Frozen bank requires pending and exact epoch. APP_UID input epoch must0.
+ * ACTIVE selects the actual active bank under stats_lock, requires its exact
+ * nonzero epoch, and never swaps, ACKs, clears or marks a bank pending.
+ * Read counters/row count/loss/sequence belong to one locked snapshot. As with
+ * A17's active map iteration, new packets can arrive after that snapshot.
  * Loss counts real failed update attempts, not estimated lost packets.
  */
